            "sizeBytes": "123456789",
            "steps": [
                {
                    "stepItems": [
                        {
                            "autoplay": true,
                            "type": "video",
                            "videoUrl": "https://helpx.adobe.com/content/dam/help/en/premiere-pro/how-to/in-app/import-footage-travel-video/7a878daf-4558-4d60-9b18-89a0524b5e5b.mp4"
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Create a new project",
                            "type": "heading"
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "In this tutorial, I'll show you how to organize your project to set the foundation for editing your video. Watch the video above to learn how to create a new project.",
                            "type": "text"
                        },
                        {
                            "texts": [
                                "In the video, I show you how to create a new project using <$Import$> mode. <$Please note$> that switching to <$Import$> mode will close the <$Learn$> panel and hide this tutorial. To reopen it, switch back to <$Edit$> mode."
                            ],
                            "type": "well",
                            "wellType": "info"
                        },
                        {
                            "listItems": [
                                {
                                    "text": "So that you don't have to switch back and forth, I've already created a project for you, which is open in the <$Project$> panel."
                                },
                                {
                                    "text": "Click <$Next$> when you're ready to move to the next step."
                                }
                            ],
                            "type": "listSubsteps"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "stepItems": [
                        {
                            "autoplay": true,
                            "type": "video",
                            "videoUrl": "https://helpx.adobe.com/content/dam/help/en/premiere-pro/how-to/in-app/import-footage-travel-video/00325339-d9a0-4716-afbd-bd90ddb38a0d.mp4"
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Create bins to organize your footage",
                            "type": "heading"
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Bins work like folders to organize your footage. Follow the instructions below to create some of your own.",
                            "type": "text"
                        },
                        {
                            "listItems": [
                                {
                                    "text": "In the <$Project$> panel, choose the <$New Bin$> icon and name this bin 01_Sequences."
                                },
                                {
                                    "text": "Select 01_Sequences. Then, choose the <$New Bin$> icon to create a new bin inside the 01_Sequences bin."
                                },
                                {
                                    "text": "Continue creating bins until your structure matches the folders below: <ul><li>01_Sequences<li>02_Footage<li>03_Audio<li>04_GFX <li>05_Stills <li>06_Extras</li></ul>"
                                }
                            ],
                            "type": "listSubsteps"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "stepItems": [
                        {
                            "autoplay": true,
                            "type": "video",
                            "videoUrl": "https://helpx.adobe.com/content/dam/help/en/premiere-pro/how-to/in-app/import-footage-travel-video/70b27d10-eae6-4ff6-8b87-89b5c64e066a.mp4"
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Import your footage",
                            "type": "heading"
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Now that your files are set up, it's time to import some footage.",
                            "type": "text"
                        },
                        {
                            "listItems": [
                                {
                                    "text": "In the <$Project$> panel, select <$02_Footage$>. Then, choose <$File$> > <$Import$> and select all of the video files that begin with CAMERA or IPHONE and click <$Import$>. You can also import your own footage during this step."
                                },
                                {
                                    "text": "I've provided a few music clips for you to practice with. Import them by choosing the <$03_Audio$> bin and importing all of the clips that begin with AUDIO."
                                }
                            ],
                            "type": "listSubsteps"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "stepItems": [
                        {
                            "successHeading": "Fantastic!",
                            "successText": "You've successfully imported footage to your project. In the next tutorial, you'll use that footage to begin editing your film.",
                            "type": "endScreen"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
